comment0.text=\n\ Wombat.\ A\ Wombat\ moves\ forward\ until\ it\ hits\ the\ edge\ of\ the\ world,\ at\n\ which\ point\ it\ turns\ left.\ If\ a\ wombat\ finds\ a\ leaf,\ it\ eats\ it.\n\n\ @author\ Michael\ K\u00F6lling\n\ @version\ 2.0\n
